Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:08.99,单语,,0,0,0,,《极限特工3：终极回归》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:45.95,注释1,,0,0,0,,(奥古斯·吉本斯 极限特工创办人)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:50.62,注释1,,0,0,0,,(凭一己之力终结了第三次世界大战)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:38.96,注释1,,0,0,0,,(小内马尔 极限特工积极招聘者)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.13,0:04:42.05,注释1,,0,0,0,,(擅长脚下功夫的天才 20岁时已射进100个龙门)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.47,0:04:45.14,注释1,,0,0,0,,(他以为是被复仇者联盟征召)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:16.00,注释1,,0,0,0,,(纽约市 中央情报局总部)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.85,0:12:32.35,注释1,,0,0,0,,(第一级战备等级)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.88,0:17:16.72,注释1,,0,0,0,,(第一守则 不要滑倒)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.35,0:17:20.18,注释1,,0,0,0,,(多米尼加共和国 圣多明哥)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.55,0:33:09.21,注释1,,0,0,0,,(阿黛尔·沃夫 最多骨折纪录保持者)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.38,0:33:12.34,注释1,,0,0,0,,(使命召唤名称：荡妇）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.01,0:33:14.68,注释1,,0,0,0,,(最爱电影：狮子与我)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.72,0:33:55.05,注释1,,0,0,0,,(泰尼森·托奇 特技车手 车祸次数为198)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.22,0:33:57.68,注释1,,0,0,0,,(声称自己被外星人挟持过两次)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.85,0:33:59.85,注释1,,0,0,0,,(维持最长的一段恋情对象：他的橄榄球护齿具)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.77,0:34:52.57,注释1,,0,0,0,,(尼奇“尼克斯”周 别名“兜帽侠”)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.74,0:34:55.61,注释1,,0,0,0,,(在同一个夜晚约会过 泰勒斯·威夫特和女神卡卡)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.82,0:34:57.49,注释1,,0,0,0,,(特长：欢乐制造者)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.24,0:35:01.08,注释1,,0,0,0,,(哈里·欧康诺)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.41,0:38:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,(菲律宾 卡拉摩安岛)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.69,0:27:58.20,注释1,,0,0,0,,(英国 莱肯希思 皇家空军基地)
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.75,0:58:04.04,注释1,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.47,1:10:06.39,注释1,,0,0,0,,(第200次车祸 来自底特律的问候)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.11,0:50:14.03,注释1,,0,0,0,,(机密)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.99,1:02:00.99,注释1,,0,0,0,,(密歇根州)
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.41,1:02:04.41,注释1,,0,0,0,,(底特律)
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.58,1:02:13.75,注释1,,0,0,0,,(密歇根州 底特律)
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.33,1:05:00.42,注释1,,0,0,0,,(选择卫星)
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.54,1:28:31.75,注释1,,0,0,0,,(达瑞斯·斯通 2005年加入极限特工)
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.83,1:28:33.04,注释1,,0,0,0,,(前美国海军军官)
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.37,1:28:36.29,注释1,,0,0,0,,(花了11年时间 等待有人拨打9号)
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.35,1:29:35.02,注释1,,0,0,0,,(选择卫星)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:40.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,知道我是如何想出 极限特工这个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how I came up with the idea for the Triple-X program?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:42.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,滑板和泳池\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skateboards and swimming pools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.79,0:03:54.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,滑板动作曾被局限在地面上 是属于青少年的交通工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skateboards used to be stuck on the ground. Adolescent transportation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.75,0:03:57.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,但在1977年改革了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then 1977 happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:03:59.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,南加州遭遇了特大旱灾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big drought hits Southern California.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:04.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,灾情之重 连那些有钱佬别墅的泳池都没有水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got so bad, rich suburbanites couldn't afford to fill their swimming pools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.30,0:04:07.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这时候 有个小子灵机一动…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's when the light clicked on. Some kid figured out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:12.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,他想到自己可以在 空荡荡的泳池里用滑板半空跳跃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he could skate those empty pools and get some real nasty air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.48,0:04:16.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有看过电影 《狗镇和滑板少年》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dogtown and Z-Boys. You ever seen it? It's a movie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:18.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,无所谓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.48,0:04:21.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,反正我们这位英雄 开始在滑板上…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyhow, our hero starts doing things on a board{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.86,0:04:24.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,做出各种 没人见识过的花招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that no one's ever seen before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.28,0:04:27.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是这世界上 意想不到的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things the world thought were impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.04,0:04:31.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,对那小子而言 干旱来的正是时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that kid needed that drought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:35.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,这世界也急需 那些空荡荡的泳池\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world needed those empty pools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:36.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,极限特工便诞生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why Triple-X.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:50.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你今天比昨天感觉更有安全感吗 我倒不觉得如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you feel safer today than you felt yesterday? I know I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:53.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,美军是这世上 最雄伟以及昂贵的军队…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The biggest, most expensive military in the world,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:57.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们却被恐怖份子 惹得不得安宁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we're still scared of shoe and tighty-whitey bombs at the airport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:04:58.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,为何会如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:05:02.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为士兵是训练来 服从命令和抗战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because soldiers are built to take orders and fight wars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:06.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是 朋友 我们面临的并非战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we, my friend, are not at war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:09.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们面对的是恐怖威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are at peril.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:12.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,极限特工便诞生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why Triple-X.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.21,0:05:15.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了 你在节食 你不饿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter? You on a diet? You ain't hungry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:17.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在是早晨7点半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's 7:30 in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:21.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,那又如何 在世界的某处 已是午餐或晚餐时间了 吃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So? It's lunch or dinnertime somewhere in the world. Come on, eat up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:25.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道谁才感觉到安全 手握公权者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who does feel safe? The men in charge. The world beaters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.84,0:05:29.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,掌握着权力的有钱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The top-shelf, par excellence ayatollahs with all the dollahs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:33.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为那些混蛋 自以为合乎正道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's because those righteous bastards, somewhere along the way,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.74,0:05:38.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,与魔鬼做了交易 他们以自由来交换安全…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}made a deal with the devil. They traded liberty for safety. And us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.19,0:05:39.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,而我们人民…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we the people,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:43.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,却赔上了自由和安全 极限特工便诞生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ended up losing both. That's why Triple-X.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.53,0:05:45.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,正当大家还被 局限在地面时…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While everybody else is stuck on the ground,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:49.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们已经在秀出各种 前所未闻的滑板花招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're doing shit on the board nobody's ever even seen before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.70,0:05:52.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是我的推销策略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's my pitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:56.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我当间谍远胜于 当个销售员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always was a better spy than a salesman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.65,0:05:58.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以…你意下如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.99,0:06:01.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是英雄 我只是一名足球员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a hero. I'm just a footballer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:05.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是我搞错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.80,0:06:07.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不妨碍你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Ill leave you be, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.47,0:06:13.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁说这世上没有 免费的…一餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who said there's no such thing as a free meal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:26.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,全都趴下 把钱交出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down on the ground, now! Give me the money!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:28.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move! Hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.61,0:06:29.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,动作快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.99,0:06:34.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,射进龙门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.25,0:06:42.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还说自己不是英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you say you're no hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:44.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,那真是一派胡言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to call bullshit on that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:50.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你正是这世界需要 的英雄人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're exactly the kind of hero the world needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.01,0:06:54.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,一切事物总归来说 还是围绕着同一个问题…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the end of the day, it comes down to the same question{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:57.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在二十年以来 每个周五晚上都会问我太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been asking my wife every Friday night for the last 20 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.27,0:07:00.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想要亲热吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want some of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:02.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是想要…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or are you just gonna...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.31,0:07:41.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,批准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Access granted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.74,0:07:55.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you may sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:07:58.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.33,0:08:03.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,这套仪器搞垮了卫星 也杀死了吉本斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is the device that crashed the satellite and killed Gibbons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:07.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,实验室内的知识份子 称这为"潘多拉魔盒"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nerds in the lab have coined it "Pandora's Box.!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:20.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的团队回溯出 卫星最后信号来自迈阿密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My team backtracked the satellite's last signal input to Miami.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.52,0:08:23.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,在丽思卡尔顿顶层公寓享乐的某位混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some asshole living the high life at the Ritz-Carlton penthouse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.19,0:08:24.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,以为他可以只手遮天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thought he could hold the world ransom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.36,0:08:28.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,三颗眩晕手榴弹 两颗子弹 以及一个尸体袋后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three flashbangs, two bullets, and one body bag later,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.86,0:08:30.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们接管了这套仪器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we took custody of the device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.61,0:08:32.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们设下了上百个 合适的冗余…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must have over 100 redundancies in place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:35.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,防止任何持有笔记本电脑 的骇客劫持卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to prevent some punk with a laptop from hijacking satellites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.03,0:08:39.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,潘多拉魔盒却能 轻易绕过所有防守设施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Pandora's Box can bypass all of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:45.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要按下按钮 就能轻易窃听保密通信…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the push of a button, it can eavesdrop on secure communications,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:50.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,损坏军事软件 传输虚假智能情报…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}corrupt military software, transmit false intelligence, or{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.22,0:08:54.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,或是像该死的核武器 从天空中撞出一颗卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}crash a satellite out of the sky like a goddamn tactical warhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.55,0:08:58.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,这仪器一定 出自你们其中一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of you is behind this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.22,0:09:01.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在查出之前 誓不罢休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I am not leaving here until I find out who.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.36,0:10:30.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,你用书本来攻击我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fight me with a book?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.69,0:10:33.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧 兄弟 第一章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go, brother. Chapter one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.98,0:10:34.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,第一页\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Page one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.65,0:10:38.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,世事难料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.01,0:10:59.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're late!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:02.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,时间刚刚好 老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just in time, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:29.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们闯进来 掐着我们的脖子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They bust in here, step on our throats,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:32.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,盗走了足以毁灭世界 的单一仪器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and take the one device that can cause a global power shift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:36.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要如何取回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, how do we get it back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:41.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,那班混蛋轻而易举地 击败了我们的精英部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These assholes just took out the best of the best like it was Sunday brunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.55,0:11:44.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要一个与他们 势均力敌的间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need someone who can move like them, fight like them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.89,0:11:47.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个人能够与龙卷风 正面交锋…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need someone who can walk into a tornado,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.98,0:11:51.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,并将其当作 万分温和的微风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and come out the other side like it was a damn gentle breeze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.31,0:11:55.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你认识这般人物吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know someone like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:57.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,不认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:12:00.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,吉本斯却认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Gibbons did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:43.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,–你在做什么 –那太疯狂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What you doing? - ThaVs loco, chico!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:51.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,桑德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xander!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:58.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,桑德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xander!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.75,0:14:19.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 朋友…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey friend...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:21.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}give me a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.78,0:15:28.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,球赛开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here we go, we are undeiway!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:51.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,桑德 我就知道你能办到 你把世界带给了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xander! I knew you would do it, Xander. You brought the world to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.64,0:15:54.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,世界这么大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world is big,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.14,0:15:57.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你可以把它放在心中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but always fits in your heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.64,0:15:59.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要永远放眼世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it with you always{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.31,0:16:01.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,快去看球赛吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.11,0:16:08.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,桑德·凯奇大可以 像个普通人一样…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, Xander Cage can't pay the satellite company,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.11,0:16:11.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,付费给卫星公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just like a regularguy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:15.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:18.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,让那些亿万富翁 更加有钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And line the pockets of some boardroom billionaires?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.12,0:16:21.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是知道的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:25.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,人一旦变得平凡 就不再特别了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these days, a regular guy can't afford to be regular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:28.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:39.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,这世界变小了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}World getting smaller?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.04,0:17:41.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道这感受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.87,0:17:45.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,逃避问题是解决不了 任何事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Running from your problems never works out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.29,0:17:47.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你需要一套新的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need a new plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:50.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要的是一份新的地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a new map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.38,0:17:57.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,别说我没警告你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't say I didn't warn you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:43.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:46.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,又来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.98,0:18:48.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,别动 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down! Get down! Don't move, asshole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.69,0:18:54.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,快跪下 你这王八蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your knees now, you son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.19,0:18:57.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是真心想妥协的 但被你搞乱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay. I want to comply. I really wanna comply. But you're confusing me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.61,0:19:02.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,"别动 混蛋"以及"跪下 王八蛋" 我该服从哪一项\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Don't move, you asshole." "On your knees, you son of a bitch.!! Which is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.28,0:19:04.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,–你只有三秒钟时间 –你的做法不太有效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have three seconds to comply! - You're not good at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:05.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:07.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:23.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:26.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,现身吧 科学怪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on out, Frankenstein!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:30.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,吉本斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gibbons! Gibbons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.69,0:19:33.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,数到三 你可以出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oily-oily-oxen-free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.65,0:19:39.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇 你看起来大不相同 吉本斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really do look different, Gibbons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.99,0:19:41.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你瘦了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you lose weight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.49,0:19:44.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,奥古斯对你的评语…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Augustus always had such, well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:47.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,一向来都不太乐观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not exactly nice things to say about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:51.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是在何时发现 这一切都是虚构的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did you realize it was all fake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:53.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你指的是你策划的这场闹剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean the clown show?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:55.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你安排埋伏的人 戴着一副昂贵的名牌耳机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had a guy over there wearing$1 ,000 Beats{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.05,0:19:57.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,冒牌货只需一半的价格 就能到手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you can buy the knockoff for half the price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.26,0:20:02.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,那位女士赶着去搭的巴士 两小时后才开走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or the lady that was running to catch a bus that doesn't leave for two hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:05.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有用外币 购买汽水的保安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or the security guard over there buying a soda with foreign currency?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:07.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道最大的败笔是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what the kicker was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.06,0:20:09.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,《世界多么美好》演员的客串\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clarence from It's a Wonderful Life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.23,0:20:13.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,那位你安排坐在我旁边 拿着一袋炸弹的老好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The nice old man that you had sit down next to me with the bag of bombs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.40,0:20:16.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,他就那么恰巧知道我会说英文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just happened to know I spoke English.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.40,0:20:18.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是令人难以预料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go figure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.74,0:20:22.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,–子弹有可能是真实的 –那么防弹衣也肯定得是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The bullets could've been real. - Then the body armor would've been real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.78,0:20:26.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不清楚你的意愿… 但我不喜欢被人试探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know you, but... I don't like to be tested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.95,0:20:31.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,吉本斯一直深信你还活着 他从未放弃找寻你的下落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gibbons never believed you were dead! Never stopped looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.92,0:20:34.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,–他真的把你当成挚友 –那他真是个傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hell of a friend. - Yeah, well, the joke's on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.92,0:20:39.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,–因为我们从来都不是朋友 –相信我 他此刻没机会后悔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cause we were never friends. - Trust me, he's not laughing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.76,0:20:42.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,他永远也得不到任何机会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nor will he ever again, for that matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.60,0:20:48.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我从未见识过如此猖狂 的攻击手法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen anything like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:53.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,这班人手法残暴 无法无天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This group is lethal, and they don't care who or what gets in their way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:56.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我希望你会有兴趣 加入反击队伍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping you'd be interested in headlining the next fight card.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.07,0:20:59.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,七十英尺的横跨距离 加上九十英尺的高度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seventy feet across, 90 feet down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.07,0:21:01.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,三寸厚的防盗玻璃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three inches of security glass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:05.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有使用任何绳索或降落伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No rope. No line. No chute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.49,0:21:08.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们肯定很享受这个过程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet they had a blast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.49,0:21:12.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们比对全世界的数据库 却得不到任何脸部辨识结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ran facial IDs on every database in the world. Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:14.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,连超速罚单纪录也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even a match on a speeding ticket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:17.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们像是不存在的幽灵 但在现今的数码世界里…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're ghosts, in a day and age where{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.67,0:21:19.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,这绝对没有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that kind of thing is almost impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.63,0:21:21.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.47,0:21:24.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道我不会为政府机构做事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you get that I don't work for suits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.80,0:21:27.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我又为何要扫这班人的兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you think I'm gonna want to ruin all their fun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.68,0:21:29.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.60,0:21:32.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你若不为了我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you won't do it for me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.69,0:21:35.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,就当是为了吉本斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do it for Gibbons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.81,0:21:41.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的国家需要你 凯奇先生 极限特工需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your country needs you, Mr. Cage. The Triple-X program needs you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.99,0:21:43.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是时候当个爱国者了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to be a patriot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.45,0:21:46.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,按照谁的定义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By whose definition?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.20,0:21:56.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我上一次表现爱国时 被判三振出局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last time I was patriotic, I got three strikes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.50,0:21:59.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有一个人愿意 相信失败者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there was only one man who believed in the underdog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.05,0:22:03.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱国主义已灭亡了 现在只有反叛者和暴君\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patriotism is dead. There's only rebels and tyrants now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.84,0:22:05.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你属于哪一者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, which are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.56,0:22:13.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是极限特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Triple-X.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.56,0:22:19.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎归队 极限特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, welcome back, Triple-X.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.90,0:22:27.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.03,0:22:31.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,–伦敦 –为何 伦敦有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- London. - Why? What's in London?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.87,0:22:33.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,幽灵猎手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A ghost hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:35.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,或许还有我的貂皮大衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And possibly my fur coat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.75,0:23:19.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我忘了这里的景色 是如此诱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd forgotten how beautiful the view is up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.25,0:23:22.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来你找回了大衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you found your coat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.96,0:23:25.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,你答应过帮我保管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you promised to take care of it for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.63,0:23:26.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的确遵守了承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.59,0:23:29.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是来找人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I'm looking for someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.43,0:23:31.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们之间何时建立了 商业关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since when have we had a business relationship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.43,0:23:35.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我若被查到碰触电脑 会被判刑二十年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get caught even touching a computer, my ass goes away for 20.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.89,0:23:39.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,开价吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Name your price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.40,0:23:40.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道我一向公平交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I'm good for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.65,0:23:44.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,这类的情报是无价的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Information like this doesn't have a price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.11,0:23:47.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾尹司莉 一切都有价格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ainsley, everything has a price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.44,0:23:49.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然 你若没把握执行…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if you don't think you can pull itoff,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.32,0:23:52.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,或是身手大不如前 我能够理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you lost your edge, just tell me and I'll understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.49,0:23:54.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,凯奇 你知道我为何犹豫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna know what it is, Cage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.16,0:23:55.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.45,0:23:57.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我曾经认为你无人能比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to think you were the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.50,0:23:58.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,但现在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.16,0:24:01.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我发现你也不过如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, maybe I feel like you're just working for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.50,0:24:03.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.34,0:24:07.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,没人知道我来了这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody knows I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.30,0:24:09.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道我能保守秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know how I am about keeping secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.01,0:24:12.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,无论你怎么说 国际刑警装置了新的监听器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you say, but Interpol's got these new listening bugs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.30,0:24:16.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们化作隐形人 高超的科技不输英国军情六处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're practically invisible. Real M16 kind of shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.31,0:24:18.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,监听器可以融入肌肤 或辅佐在手臂下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disappear on your skin, under your arms,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.77,0:24:21.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,甚至隐藏在私密处…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tied around your balls like a Christmas bow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.98,0:24:23.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,你大可以搜身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unwrap me, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.44,0:24:32.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 有研究证明性爱接触…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, studies have proven that sexual consummation irrevocably ruins{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.99,0:24:35.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,会彻底摧毁大多数关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nine out of 10 relationships.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.83,0:24:38.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,幸运的是 你喜欢接受挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky for me, you love to gamble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.70,0:24:40.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.37,0:24:43.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.13,0:24:47.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我的朋友们喜欢 孤注一掷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friends, on the other hand, adore stiff odds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.38,0:24:51.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,孤注一掷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stiff odds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.91,0:25:22.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我为国家所作的奉献\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The things I do for my country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.83,0:25:28.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,这像是大海捞针\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like finding needles in a stack of needles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.05,0:25:33.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,你虽然在英女皇的管制下 得套上脚踝监视器…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even though you're shackled by the Queen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.55,0:25:35.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,本领依旧首屈一指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're still the best in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.84,0:25:37.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.89,0:25:40.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,帮自己一个忙 烧了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do yourself a favor. Burn this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.89,0:25:44.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我打听到你在找的这班幽灵 极具危害性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whispers I hear, these ghosts of yours are the real kind of trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.56,0:25:45.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们受过专业训练 幕后也有雄厚的资金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've got training, they've got funding,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.02,0:25:49.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,会不惜任何代价 消除阻扰他们的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they've got no problem running over anyone who gets in their way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.86,0:25:51.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,你担心我会受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so, you're worried that I mightget hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.07,0:25:53.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我担心你会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm worried you might get dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.07,0:25:58.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为我的安慰担忧 令我感动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I'm touched that you can imagine a world without me in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.96,0:26:04.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,这世界少了我 肯定少了欢乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be a little less fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.42,0:26:08.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要说的只有这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all I'm saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.93,0:26:21.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要找的那班幽灵 此刻正在菲律宾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your ghosts are hanging out in the Philippines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.39,0:26:23.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我早该料到他们会 躲到太平洋地带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Figures they'd go to the Pacific.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.10,0:26:27.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个没有网络连接的荒野\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some jungle rave that's off the grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.61,0:26:29.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是如何在短时间内查出的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell did you find it so quickly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.07,0:26:31.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,卧底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Undercover work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.44,0:27:10.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,你把潘多拉魔盒藏在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it? What did you do with Pandora's Box?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.32,0:27:13.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,在一个很安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in a safe place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.49,0:27:16.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是计划的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wasn't a part of the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.82,0:27:23.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,经过这么多年 你依然对我的临时变动感到惊讶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all these years, you're still shocked when I improvise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.87,0:27:26.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是 我们的任务是销毁它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. But the mission was to destroy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.37,0:27:28.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来另有计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turns out there's a new mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.50,0:27:32.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是不会销毁能够 让我们达到目的工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna destroy the one thing I can use to get what we want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.29,0:27:35.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,–全世界都在通缉我们 –让他们来找吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The whole world is looking for us, Xiang. - Let them come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.17,0:27:38.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只在乎棋盘里的 典当牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You worry about pawn sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.01,0:27:40.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我却瞄准了国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got my eye on the king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.35,0:27:44.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是问题所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.18,0:27:48.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你遗忘了皇后的存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You forgot the queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.36,0:28:03.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你成功消灭无政府99恐怖组织之后 吉本斯收到了一张空白支票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After your success taking down Anarchy 99, Gibbons was handed a blank check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.03,0:28:06.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,换句话说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is the long way of saying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.04,0:28:09.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,他替你购买了崭新的 代步工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he got you a new ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.54,0:28:12.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,凯奇 在你的死讯传出后 这世界经历了重大的提升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}World went and got an upgrade since you died, Cage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.38,0:28:15.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,板载无人机 防空对策…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Onboard drones, anti-air countermeasures,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.17,0:28:19.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,以及巨大容量的燃油舱 足够环球航行三遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and fuel tanks big enough to circumnavigate the globe three times{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.05,0:28:21.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,也无需降落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without ever landing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.06,0:28:29.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以把大衣挂在衣帽间 我担保没人敢偷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can check your coat. I promise you, no one would dare steal it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.89,0:28:32.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能担保貂皮大衣 不会自行溜走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't guarantee it won't walk off on its own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.23,0:28:35.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,十分钟后起飞 你们已经落后七分钟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wheels up in 10, boys! Which means you're already seven minutes behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.03,0:28:38.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,她一向来都如此有趣 或只限于特别日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she always this much fun, or just on special occasions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.29,0:28:52.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,难怪我们的国家 会欠下万亿美元债务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wonder our country's in debt trillions of dollars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.54,0:28:54.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们真需要这些高端科技 来抓坏人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really need all these gadgets to get the bad guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.92,0:28:56.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们什么都不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't need any of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.25,0:28:59.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,但这让逮捕过程 有趣多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it makes the catching a hell of a lot more fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.80,0:29:07.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,桑德·凯奇 我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xander Cage. Holy shit!{\r}
