Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.28,0:29:29.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,–就停不下来 无法… –呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and then I can't... - Breathe.{\r}
