Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.34,0:30:30.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你若需要紫色大麻 绝对不要来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you need a fifty of Purple Urkle, lam notthe girl to ask.{\r}
