Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.34,0:31:03.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们一定经历过很多 伟大的事迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys must have some seriously cool stories to tell.{\r}
