Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.08,0:31:43.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们又没有用红牛加汽水 把自己灌醉 你这混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not all jacked up on Mountain Dew and Red Bull, you asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.92,0:31:46.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,这人哪找来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd you find this guy?{\r}
