Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.61,0:32:07.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我肯定会后悔这么问… 你相信的是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I'm gonna regret asking you this, but who would you trust?{\r}
