Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.50,0:35:56.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以为狗天生就懂得 如何抓住飞盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think a dog knows how to work a Frisbee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.63,0:35:59.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,主人一声令下… 它就必须服从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master says, "Fetch," and the bitch listens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.84,0:36:02.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,你嘴里咬着飞盘 的模样一定很性感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would look so sexy with a Frisbee in that mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.51,0:36:04.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 这才不是一场游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetheart, this is not a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.31,0:36:07.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们都属我的士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are all my soldiers now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.19,0:36:10.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,–我是玩家 不是士兵 –我们看起来像士兵吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not a soldier, I'm a bailer. - Do we look like soldiers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.02,0:36:12.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,一点也不像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.19,0:36:15.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,–我把你的士兵们都丢去东欧了 –为何独漏掉拉稀警犬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I dropped your soldiers over Eastern Europe. - So, why did you leave Lassie behind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.53,0:36:18.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,这次行动由我指挥 你得听我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my operation! You will listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.53,0:36:19.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,散会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meeting's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.37,0:36:27.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,人生悲剧再多也得笑着活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, other than that, Mrs. Lincoln, how was the play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.01,0:36:38.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是超高密纤维的防弹衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, that's super-cinch body armor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.43,0:36:42.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,你必须把带子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to tighten the strap...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.39,0:36:45.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,尽量收紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.06,0:36:47.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.93,0:36:49.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以为自己是我的经纪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you, my handler?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.89,0:36:51.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能够胜任任何角色扮演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm whatever you need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.60,0:36:53.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我什么都愿意尝试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can handle anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.06,0:36:55.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的抓力也很紧实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've got a tight grip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.94,0:36:58.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,顺道一提 我不是外勤探员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And just so you know, I am not a field agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.61,0:37:01.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我从未出过任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not go out in the field. Ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.61,0:37:03.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,那里才有乐趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that's where all the fun is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.12,0:37:06.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 但我害怕有趣的事物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, fun scares me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.58,0:37:08.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,也害怕坏人跟枪支\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People scare me. Guns scare me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.75,0:37:11.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,尤其是持有枪支的坏人 我一受到惊吓就无法做事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People with guns really scare me. And if I'm scared, I can't do my job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.79,0:37:15.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,接着就会连带害死人 大家都死光了 我还能支援谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I can't do my job, then people die. And if people die, then who am I tech-supporting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.13,0:37:17.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Literally no one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.80,0:37:20.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我会尽全力保护你的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I will make sure to keep you safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.80,0:37:23.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,那并非易事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't easy to keep me safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.10,0:37:29.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 我最爱坏男孩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, these bad boys are my favorite, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.14,0:37:33.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,这称为外围手套 最新被研发的地面战斗武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're called exo-gloves. DARPA's new ground combat initiative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.65,0:37:38.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,气动会活塞驱动齿轮 令拳头有四倍的速度和力道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pneumatic pistons drive the gears, quadruple the speed and power of your punches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.15,0:37:41.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope, nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.99,0:37:44.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是多级信号干扰器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a multistage signal disruptor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.99,0:37:46.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,非常易碎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very, very breakable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.28,0:37:49.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能告诉我 泛美航班103在洛克比…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you tell me the real reason behind the crash of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.95,0:37:51.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,真正坠机的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pan Am Flight 103 over Lockerbie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.62,0:37:54.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.25,0:37:56.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和外星人是一伙的 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're one of them, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.09,0:37:59.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,当心 拳王洛基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy there, Rocky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.18,0:38:02.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说过这手套有着 强大的力道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't kidding when I said there's enough force in these bad boys{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.47,0:38:05.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,足以打爆机身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to probably punch a hole through the fricking plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.84,0:38:08.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,继续胡闹啊 还能出什么差错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep screwing around. What could possibly go wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.51,0:38:11.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,–那正是我的风格 –好的 那真是庆幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That is my style, though. - Yeah, good. Glad to hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.81,0:38:15.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 其实…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, actually,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.19,0:38:18.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还是别碰的好…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would rather if you didn't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.48,0:38:23.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是惊喜 你真的知道如何操作底部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's refreshing. You actually know what you're doing down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.53,0:38:25.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 她也曾那样说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. That's what she said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.80,0:39:28.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,有事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need something, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.30,0:39:31.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听说这地方 最适合让我的组员…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I heard this is a perfect place to disappear for a few days{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.64,0:39:34.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,不被质问地 消失几天时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for my crew, no questions asked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.31,0:39:37.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要价钱谈拢 我家就是你家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mi casa es su casa, if the price is right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.98,0:39:38.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect. Tennyson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.97,0:39:39.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,泰尼森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tennyson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.90,0:39:46.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你肯定会喜欢 我有南太平洋最好的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna like this. I just happen to have the best hardware in the South Pacific.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.00,0:39:58.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,拿百分之三十来交换 我们这里尚好的待客礼仪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}30% off the top gets you our finest hospitality package.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.33,0:40:01.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,三十 有包括周末陪伴的女郎 再附送两棵椰子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}30% off the top? Do I get the girls for a weekend and two coconuts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.92,0:40:03.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,百分之十\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}10%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.17,0:40:05.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,百分之十\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}10%?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.51,0:40:11.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,你一定是瞄准了其他 无法无天的偏僻岛屿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You musVve been aiming at the other lawless, uncharted island down the block. Happens all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.35,0:40:15.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,不如这样吧 你转过身上船 滚远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's what you do. You turn around, go get your boat. You can kiss my ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.52,0:40:18.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.14,0:40:20.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,你意下如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.44,0:40:21.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You talked me into it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.11,0:40:23.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,百分之十八\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}18%!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.69,0:40:26.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你把这当成了跳蚤市场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think this is a flea market?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.61,0:40:29.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以为我们在聚集区 售卖冒牌电视机和手表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think we're in the hood selling TVs and fake watches, or something like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.20,0:40:31.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,你搞什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with you, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.53,0:40:37.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 二十二加半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Twenty-two and a half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.71,0:40:39.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要如何计算"加半"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you gonna do "and a half"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.13,0:40:44.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,二十二…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty-two{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.05,0:40:47.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,加半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.47,0:40:58.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 尽情享受派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Enjoy this party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.98,0:41:01.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的风格 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like your style, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.31,0:41:04.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,无论如何都在船上待着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay on that boat, no matter what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.07,0:41:06.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿黛尔 尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adele, Nicks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.15,0:41:11.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位 小心藏好耳机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, guys, keep your earbuds in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.24,0:41:15.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿黛尔 一如往常 你当我天上的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like always, Adele, you're my eyes in the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.08,0:41:18.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,尼克斯 你来炒热气氛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nicks, you're gonna show'em how we do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.27,0:41:43.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.44,0:41:45.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,等着看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.80,0:42:10.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能帮我挂在吧台后面吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you keep this behind the bar for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.97,0:42:12.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,要喝什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can I get you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.55,0:42:14.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,蔓越莓汁加苏打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cranberry club soda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.14,0:42:16.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,来两杯吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make that two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.31,0:42:26.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,–谢谢 –不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.31,0:42:28.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,专注点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay focused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.32,0:42:30.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.24,0:42:39.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,桑德·凯奇重出江湖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xander Cage. Back in action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.33,0:42:42.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有离开过吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I ever leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.80,0:42:55.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.43,0:43:00.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,发现小丑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spotted our clown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.02,0:43:05.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,比想象中简单 请大家喝一杯庆祝吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easier than expected. Drinks all around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.49,0:43:17.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.35,0:43:44.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道什么 这是猎杀混蛋的季节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know? It's douchebag hunting season.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.98,0:43:46.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢的捕猎项目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.31,0:43:48.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在还没到 要杀人的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a little early in the evening to slay someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.65,0:43:51.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 让我来补救吧 - 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me fix it. - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.82,0:43:55.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,若那般舞艺还不足以被射死 我真不知道谁该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Dance Dance Revolution doesn't deserve a bullet, I don't know who does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.24,0:44:00.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,这到底是派对还是葬礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this a party or a funeral? It's a party!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.16,0:44:06.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,无论是哪一个 今晚都会有着了火的身体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Either way, somebody's getting turnt up tonight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.02,0:44:28.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说过他擅长制造欢乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you he was fun to have around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.38,0:44:56.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我起初以为你是特种部队一员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At first, I thought Special Forces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.55,0:44:59.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你却布满纹身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But your ink's all wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.97,0:45:01.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,美国中央情报局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}CIA?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.72,0:45:04.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,若是他们 早就派来无人机炸死我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They would send in a drone, bomb us to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.31,0:45:06.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,英国军情六处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}M16?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.73,0:45:10.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不属于他们喜欢的低调类型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not the kind of subtle they prefer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.98,0:45:16.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,来这岛屿的人 大多都是通缉犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, the men who come to this island, they're on the run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.90,0:45:18.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了躲避这世界的追击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hiding from the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.24,0:45:20.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.41,0:45:23.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不是来逃难的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not here to hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.24,0:45:25.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为了寻人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking for someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.79,0:45:32.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁说我还没找到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And who's to say I haven't already found her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.59,0:45:39.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这番话是想吓唬我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was that meant to scare me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.42,0:45:41.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你若配上几分颤抖 会更逼真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little tremble would be nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.76,0:45:43.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个嘛…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.93,0:45:47.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,看在你只差一步就得 坡脚离开这里…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}considering you're one tremble away from limping out of here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.77,0:45:52.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我胜券在握\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}? . .I'd say I'm close enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.19,0:45:55.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的意思是 明早不会帮我做早餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this mean you're not making me breakfast in the morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.19,0:46:01.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还差几寸距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say you're a couple inches off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.45,0:46:09.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,碰上僵局了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bit of a stalemate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.29,0:46:11.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要你放下枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if you drop the gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.29,0:46:13.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是坏人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not the bad guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.75,0:46:17.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不相信好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe in good guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.80,0:46:18.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,赛琳娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Serena?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.13,0:46:24.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.89,0:46:26.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们才刚认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.22,0:46:30.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,但相处愉快 直到被某人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we were getting along famously until somebody{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.98,0:46:32.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,蓄意打断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}decided to interrupt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.31,0:46:34.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,安分点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stick to the path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.48,0:46:36.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,拿去吧 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.56,0:46:39.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,这岛屿上有众多 无名牌的坟墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a lot of unmarked graves on the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.82,0:46:45.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我敢说卖你那件上衣的人 就是其中一具死尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ill bet whoever sold you that shirt is in one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.82,0:46:48.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你打算嚣张多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how long do you intend to push your luck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.33,0:46:51.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,直到我到达目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until I get what I came for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.37,0:46:54.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的目的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is what exactly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.50,0:46:59.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,最烈的酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A damn stiff drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.86,0:47:26.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们坦诚相见吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, let's be real and talk about what we all really want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.46,0:47:35.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我为了那东西而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm only here for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.79,0:47:40.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们大可完好的离去 除非你想延续我们之前的调情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in my mind, you guys could walk away nicely. Unless you want to continue our foreplay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.88,0:47:44.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,这般威力不该 属于任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power like that doesn't belong in anyone's hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.22,0:47:47.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不过即兴发表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just improvising.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.56,0:47:59.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是吧 手榴弹 这里是九十初年代的东欧吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mate, seriously? A grenade? Mate, seriously? A grenade? What is this? Eastern Europe in 1990s?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.90,0:48:01.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,他接着会给你发传真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next, he's gonna send you a fax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.73,0:48:04.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为了独吞那东西…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you're willing to kill{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.15,0:48:06.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,愿意杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just to keep that for yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.24,0:48:08.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,你问错问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the wrong question to ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.24,0:48:11.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,要如何问才是正确的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the right question?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.91,0:48:15.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,"你愿意为此死吗 "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Are you willing to die for it?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.92,0:48:24.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,一颗手榴弹 三个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One grenade, three people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.42,0:48:25.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢孤注一掷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like the odds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.93,0:48:34.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,两颗手榴弹 三个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two grenades, three people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.14,0:48:37.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱死了这场胜算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm loving these odds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.86,0:48:45.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有试过流了大量的血 眼前只有一片血染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever bleed so much, when you open your eyes, all you see is red?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.78,0:48:48.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,当你在每个陆地上 都战斗过…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you have fought war on every continent...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.78,0:48:52.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要你一声口令 我就让这班混蛋上西天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, X, just say the word. Let me put both these assholes out to pasture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.12,0:48:54.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你等待的只有死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you expect death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.62,0:48:56.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,人的身体是脆弱不堪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our bodies are such fragile things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.70,0:48:57.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我来射死他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let me shoot him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.96,0:48:59.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,死亡有时候会…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death sometimes just{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.62,0:49:02.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,出其不意的发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sneaks up on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.67,0:49:05.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很久没玩"烫手山芋" 这游戏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a while since I played hot potato.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.01,0:49:08.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我躺在医院的病床上…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in this hospital bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.84,0:49:12.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,神志不清 出现幻觉 四周都是自己流的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm barely conscious. Delirious. Drowning in my own blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.85,0:49:16.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我脑海里只听到 "就是今天了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all I can hear myself think is, !!Today!s the day.!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.47,0:49:18.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,"今天是你死亡的日子"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}!!Today!s the day you die.!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.48,0:49:20.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很有感触\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm touched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.31,0:49:22.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能要回大衣吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I have my jacket, when you get a sec?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.06,0:49:25.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,接着走来了一个男人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then a man comes along, tells me a story{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.82,0:49:28.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我一个关于加州干旱的故事…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about a drought in California.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.49,0:49:31.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,其中还有滑板和泳池\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About skateboards and swimming pools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.66,0:49:35.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,以及一个名为桑德·凯奇的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About a man named Xander Cage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.53,0:49:38.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死的 他是极限特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit. He's Triple-X.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.54,0:49:43.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听闻他死掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard he was dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.21,0:49:48.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,是真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.22,0:49:53.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都是极限特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are all Triple-X.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.05,0:49:56.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,只不过有不同的议程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just have different agendas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.01,0:49:58.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,她想要销毁这东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wants to destroy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.77,0:50:01.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想要加以利用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.52,0:50:06.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你若把这带回国家安全局 我们就玩完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll be damned if I'm gonna let you take it back to the NSA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.88,0:50:30.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,派对现在开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, it's a party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.36,0:50:50.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,老实点 老实点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, get down! Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.40,0:50:52.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,要出大事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit's about to go down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.74,0:50:54.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好狂欢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready to have some fun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.41,0:50:57.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,把音乐关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn off the music!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.57,0:50:58.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,停止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.42,0:51:09.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家把手举起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, hands up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.13,0:51:10.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.17,0:51:13.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the floor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.51,0:51:17.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,第一个移动的人就得死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First person to move, first person to die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.69,0:51:25.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我移动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.65,0:51:33.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我又移动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just moved again. I'm still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.61,0:51:34.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.11,0:51:36.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴吧"英雄 "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, "hero"!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.82,0:51:39.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.95,0:51:41.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.49,0:51:42.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.83,0:51:48.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我手上有你要的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I actually have what you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.00,0:51:51.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,潘多拉魔盒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pandora's Box?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.63,0:51:53.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,就在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.67,0:51:55.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're wrong, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.67,0:51:59.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,你若从我这里拿走 就等着死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take it from me, and you die first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.35,0:52:02.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,接着死的会是自以为能保卫你的 列宁格勒中尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then Lieutenant Leningrad, who thinks he's got your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.97,0:52:04.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,再来就是看守门口 叫做埃文的两位士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then the two Ivans by the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.18,0:52:07.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,吧台的莫斯科骡子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moscow Mule by the bar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.02,0:52:11.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,最后是楼梯旁的伊戈尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then Igor on the stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.02,0:52:14.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,你听清楚接下来会发生的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See where we're going with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.03,0:52:17.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,但全都无所谓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But none of that matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.53,0:52:20.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我说过了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cause like I said,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.33,0:52:25.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你若从我这里拿走… 就等着死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you take this from me, you die first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.21,0:52:28.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不管你是生或死 都会把那东西抢走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ill take it from you dead or alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.13,0:52:34.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你若是抓得太紧 我就切下你的手臂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you hold it too tight, I cut your arm off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.05,0:52:36.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,随你便吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suit yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.72,0:52:46.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,列宁格勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leningrad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.23,0:52:48.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 埃文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Ivan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.77,0:52:49.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,另一名埃文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other Ivan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.74,0:53:01.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,再见了 莫斯科骡子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye-bye, Moscow Mule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.54,0:53:08.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,伊戈尔 你又欠我人情了 桑德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Igor. That's another one you owe me, X.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.21,0:53:11.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,注意两指之间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Read between the lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.73,0:53:30.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,泰尼森 你应该来支援我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tennyson! Some back-up would be nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.23,0:53:33.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,来支援我们 快啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some back-up would be nice! Come on, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.06,0:53:35.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,桑德说过我得在船上待着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}X said stay on the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.40,0:53:42.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是俄罗斯人入侵之前的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was before the goddamn Russian invasion touched down, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.17,0:55:19.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,桑德说过我得在船上待着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}X said stay on the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.35,0:55:37.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要加入游戏吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.62,0:57:21.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,这东西不属于任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't belong in anyone's hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.29,0:57:25.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,想要的话…就来抢走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want it, come and get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.59,0:57:30.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,有必要这样做吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was that necessary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.43,0:57:33.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,这会是吉本斯的意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's what Gibbons would have wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.14,0:57:39.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,桑德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}X!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.77,0:57:43.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,桑德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}x.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.77,0:57:46.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,又发生了 另一颗卫星跌落了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It happened again. Another satellite fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.74,0:57:51.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们应该携手合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Us working as a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.07,0:57:55.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,这才是吉本斯的意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what Gibbons would've wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.75,0:57:59.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要加入吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.83,0:58:03.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,莫斯科奥林匹克体育场 发生爆炸事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An explosion inside the Olympic Stadium rocks Moscow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.17,0:58:06.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,有七名员工已被证实死亡…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven workers are now confirmed dead,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.17,0:58:10.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,这起毫无意义的暴力 也造成至少25位伤者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with at least 25 others injured in this senseless act of violence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.51,0:58:12.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,来自五角大楼的消息指出…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A source inside the Pentagon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.76,0:58:16.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,一颗离群的卫星 已被用作武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}says a rogue satellite may have been used as a weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.18,0:58:20.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来潘多拉魔盒 并非机密档案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess this means Pandora's Box isn't exactly classified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.14,0:58:24.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,在刚发布的新视频中 一组匿名团体…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a new video released just moments ago, an anonymous group{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.98,0:58:28.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,声称自己有能力把 卫星用作武器 他们道出…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is claiming to have the ability to use satellites as weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.80,0:58:33.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,"侵犯全世界市民的公民权利…"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They claim "that the violation of civil liberties "of all the citizens of the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.82,0:58:35.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,"是一项必须被阻止的暴行"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"is an atrocity that must be stopped."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.45,0:58:41.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,在接下来的24小时内 禁止并拆除全世界的间谍程序…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disable and dismantle all the world's spy programs within the next 24 hours,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.87,0:58:44.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,否则我就亲自动手 一次引爆一颗卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or I will do it for you one satellite at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.04,0:58:47.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,地球此刻被 三万颗卫星环绕着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are 30,000 satellites orbiting the Earth at this moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.17,0:58:52.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会每24小时落下一颗卫星 直到我的要求被达成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will drop one satellite eveiy 24 hours until my demands are met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.13,0:58:54.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,在莫斯科的目击证人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyewitnesses in Moscow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.80,0:58:57.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,–这也是你计划的一部分 –当然不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Was this always part of your mission, too? - Of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.22,0:59:01.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是吉本斯新打造的 极限特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were a new Triple-X team Gibbons created.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.18,0:59:06.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们查出一名高级智能官员 正试图操纵卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We discovered a high-level intelligence officer was trying to manipulate satellites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.86,0:59:09.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,但还来不及 掀开他的真面目…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And even before we could unmask him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.86,0:59:11.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,吉本斯就遭到毒手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gibbons was killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.53,0:59:13.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,原来你一早就知道 他们是极限特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you knew they were Triple-X all along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.74,0:59:16.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要你对这次行动 保留该有的客观感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I needed you to retain a sense of objectivity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.70,0:59:20.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不明白 潘多拉魔盒已被我销毁 为何会出现在莫斯科\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand. If I destroyed Pandora's Box, what happened in Moscow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.70,0:59:22.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我若没猜错的话…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I'm right, which I am,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.87,0:59:26.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,潘多拉魔盒只能 操控一颗卫星…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this box only ever had the ability to control one satellite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.38,0:59:27.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.88,0:59:30.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们追击的 不过是一个样板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means we've been chasing a prototype.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.59,0:59:33.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,–真实的却落入了这班人手中 –没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And these guys have the real one? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.85,0:59:44.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们被赛琳娜耍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Serena played us for fools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.19,0:59:47.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,她背叛了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Betrayed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.19,0:59:51.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不关系到赛琳娜 这是一场战争…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't about Serena. This is war. And either{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.53,0:59:54.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们今天要是不制止他 明天世界就会被毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we stop it today, or we watch the world burn tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.33,0:59:56.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们得以大事为重 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can't lose focus on that. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.95,1:00:01.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你到哪去了 去寻欢作乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you been? You stop off for the old rub-and-tug?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.20,1:00:02.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,你母亲问候你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mom says hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.54,1:00:05.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你放置了追踪器 没被人发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tracker on board? Nobody saw you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.79,1:00:07.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,–我一直都来去无踪 –很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nobody ever sees me, boss. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.46,1:00:12.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些官员操控着 所有在空中的卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, these suits control every spy satellite in the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.55,1:00:16.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,但这七员有多常机会 同时聚集在一个房间内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how often do these seven men all sit in the same room together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.13,1:00:18.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,几乎没有过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.72,1:00:21.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,若需要视网膜扫描…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you needed retinal scans,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.89,1:00:26.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,全世界握拳人士的 手机数据转储 生物识别…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cell phone data dumps, biometrics of all the superpowers in the world,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.98,1:00:29.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会锁定谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who would you target?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.65,1:00:30.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.65,1:00:34.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,有谁握有聚集 那类资讯的权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who has that kind of power to actually set that in motion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.57,1:00:39.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怀疑错人了 是我来找你的 记得吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're pissing up the wrong tree, Cage. I came looking for you, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.66,1:00:42.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 混蛋 我们惹麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, asshole. We gonna have problems?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.58,1:00:45.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事 你的旅程还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem. How was your trip?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.25,1:00:47.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不过是做做算术罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just doing the math.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.17,1:00:50.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗 何种算术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? What math?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.54,1:00:53.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,空气速度除以距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Air velocity divided by distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.92,1:00:58.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以当我把你塞入马桶时 搜寻队伍会知道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, when I stuff you down the toilet, search and rescue will know where{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.34,1:01:00.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,得在中国和北韩之间 找到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to find you between China and North Korea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.59,1:01:02.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,继续胡扯吧 小人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep talking shit, little man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.43,1:01:04.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,切记你说的话 特种部队士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold that thought, G.l. Joe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.77,1:01:08.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,倒转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roll it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.19,1:01:10.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,多一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.02,1:01:11.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,再多一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.11,1:01:15.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,停止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little more. Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.36,1:01:18.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,当翔撞破玻璃时…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, when Xiang broke the window,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.62,1:01:25.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有他临危不乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's the only one that didn't flinch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.54,1:01:27.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,替我接通总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need the President on the phone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.12,1:01:31.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道那是清除不了的吗 我得把整个银幕换掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not gonna come off, you know that, right? I'll have to replace the goddamn screen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.13,1:01:35.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我早说过了 中央情报局局长想要毁灭世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been saying the director of the CIA has been trying to destroy the world for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.88,1:01:39.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们被全权委任 拘捕这个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we have carte blanche to track this son of a bitch down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.80,1:01:42.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们有谁知道该如何着手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do any of you know how to do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.55,1:01:45.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,用回我和翔在纽约找出 潘多拉盒子的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same way Xiang and I found Pandora's Box in New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.23,1:01:51.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,由于卫星不间断的旋转 潘多拉盒子必须重复连接信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pandora's Box needs to keep reconnecting itself because the satellites orbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.15,1:01:53.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,请让一让\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.32,1:01:56.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们只需查出 主要信号的来源…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All we need to do is track down the main signal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.98,1:01:59.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,就能锁定它在 20英里半径距离内的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then we can approximate its location within a 20-mile radius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.24,1:02:07.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,在众多可以隐藏的地方…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of all the places in the world to lay low,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.00,1:02:10.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,这疯子竟然选择了底特律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this fruit loop chooses Detroit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.67,1:02:21.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,爆炸事件虽然发生在莫斯科 世界各地却感受到了余震\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These blasts did take place in Moscow, but they were felt around the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.26,1:02:26.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,莫斯科这场悲剧的 死亡人数持续增加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning. As feared, the death toll in the Moscow tragedy is rising.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.68,1:02:28.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,死伤之余…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In addition to the latest deaths..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.35,1:02:32.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我猜想看 世界各国都趁机拆卸间谍程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess. Everyone's jumping at the chance to dismantle their spy programs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.85,1:02:34.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.52,1:02:39.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,全世界没那么聪明 能看穿莫斯科事件是真实的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world's too stupid to realize that Moscow wasn't a bluff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.45,1:02:46.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,极限特工 你们的基地将设在 国家安全局的安全屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Triple-X, you will base out of an NSA safe house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.28,1:02:51.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝姬会通过耳机操控支援 并使信号中断器处于待机状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Becky will coordinate earbud communications and have the signal disruptor on standby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.29,1:02:54.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,当我为了救你一命 而把船撞击上岸…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nicks, when I crashed the boat up on shore and saved your life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.04,1:02:56.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,随你便 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, whatever, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.63,1:03:01.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说那次能正式算是 第199的车祸吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}.do you think that counts as crash 199 for me? You know, officially?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.05,1:03:03.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,正式而言 你是个疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officially, you're deranged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.55,1:03:07.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.72,1:03:11.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们将设置一个三角形 的信号跟踪系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll set up a triangulated signal tracking system around the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.31,1:03:14.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝姬一旦锁定他的正确位置 我们就开始行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when Becky locks in his exact location, we make our move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.40,1:03:18.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你呢 你是如何参与的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you? How did you get roped into all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.90,1:03:22.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在摩天大楼上涂鸦 被判服刑一年监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tagged a skyscraper and got a year in jail for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.40,1:03:23.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.16,1:03:26.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,太极端了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems excessive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.24,1:03:29.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,那涂鸦长达三十楼层高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tag was 30 stories tall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.16,1:03:31.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,在网上的视频点阅率高达两百万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two million hits on YouTube.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.16,1:03:34.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也只服刑了一半时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I served only half the sentence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.58,1:03:37.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我猜想 吉本斯来拯救了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess. Gibbons to the rescue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.25,1:03:40.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,他说像我这般野心 不适合被关在任何笼子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yup. He said a lion like me doesn't belong in any kind of cage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.76,1:03:52.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在离开国家安全局后纹上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got mine after I left the NSA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.77,1:03:55.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,–你手腕上的呢 –在伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about that one on your wrist? - London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.77,1:03:58.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,2009年 我成功登上千禧之轮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2009. I climbed the Millennium Wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.86,1:04:00.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,光着身子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Naked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.94,1:04:02.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,–光着 –没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Naked? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.94,1:04:04.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,高中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.28,1:04:07.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.12,1:04:11.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都有过不堪回首的往事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all have our embarrassing moments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.46,1:04:16.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个性感的呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about that sexy one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.62,1:04:19.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个 浴火凤凰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This? Phoenix out of the ashes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.79,1:04:21.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在墨西哥的一张椅子上 花了十八小时完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eighteen hours in a chair in Mexico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.13,1:04:24.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我灌下了和我体重相等 的龙舌兰酒才能撑下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I drank my bodyweight in tequila to get through it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.80,1:04:27.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,这也是最具意义的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the most important one, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.14,1:04:32.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是在那时候 决定要与世界为伍…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's when I decided to change the world instead of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.97,1:04:34.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,而非对抗一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rage against it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.98,1:04:41.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们找到他了 也查出潘多拉盒子的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found him. We found Pandora's Box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.03,1:04:44.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,桑德 有收到吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xander, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.19,1:04:48.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,收到 派上泰尼森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here. Okay, send Tennyson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.36,1:04:52.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,404号东国会街 他在顶楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like East 404 Congress Street. He's on the top floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.42,1:05:05.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我接收到潘多拉盒子有动静…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm showing activity in Pandora's Box. I can jam the signal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.34,1:05:08.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只能暂时制止信号几分钟时间 你们动作要快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but only for a few minutes, so hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.76,1:05:13.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们得赶紧抵达 将他压制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to get there fast and take this guy down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.10,1:05:20.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得先找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if we find him first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.28,1:05:28.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,红灯 红灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red light! Red light! Red light!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.87,1:05:38.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,交通信号是石油机构发明来 浪费燃料和增加利润的伎俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know traffic signals were invented by Big Oil{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.21,1:05:41.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我如果附和你 你能开慢点吗 小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I say yes, will you please just slow down? Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.88,1:05:44.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.80,1:05:49.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是否得在这一刻 担任婊子角色来警告我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this the part where you act the basic bitch and tell me you got your eye on me and that you don't trust me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.72,1:05:51.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,解答正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.40,1:06:06.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,每个人都需要后备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone needs backup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.24,1:06:11.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,停停 停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop, stop, stop, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.74,1:06:12.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,停停 停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop, stop, stop, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.16,1:06:19.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,泰尼森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tennyson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.42,1:06:23.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,交通大堵塞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gridlocked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.92,1:06:25.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.42,1:06:28.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你若遇上麻烦…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you run into trouble,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.84,1:06:30.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,拨打9号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dial nine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.84,1:06:32.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是吉本斯老旧的紧急后备措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an old Gibbons fail-safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.61,1:06:50.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你打乱了我的计划 也偷走了我的拍档\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You crashed my party! Stole my dance partner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.45,1:06:52.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也来捣乱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna crash yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.11,1:06:53.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,玩的开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.28,1:06:56.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是派对 这是一场竞赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ain't a party. This is a race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.63,1:07:12.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,–你在做什么 –搭建一个坡道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell you think you're doing? Building a ramp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.23,1:07:25.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.23,1:08:08.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 给我下车 下来 - 你要干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey! Out of the car! Get out! - What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.44,1:08:09.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,快下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.67,1:09:14.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死的 他尝试重新连接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit. He's trying to reconnect it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.67,1:09:17.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只能在他选择另一颗卫星前 短暂地阻塞信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, I can only jam the signal for so long before he chooses another satellite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.03,1:09:18.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们得赶紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.47,1:09:22.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有一个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.81,1:09:25.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.31,1:09:27.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,"等等"才不是什么计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Hold on" ain't no goddamn plan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.60,1:09:32.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.46,1:09:51.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在找人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You looking for someone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.88,1:10:02.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,第两百次的撞击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's 200!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.05,1:10:23.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.58,1:10:31.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.31,1:10:33.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,桑德 你必须到达顶楼 他正在启动另一颗卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xander, you gotto getto the top floor. He's trying to engage another satellite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.58,1:10:34.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,动作快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huriy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.06,1:10:50.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,小事一桩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fish in a barrel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.24,1:11:05.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,四十五口径 德国自动装填手枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forty-five U.S.P.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.28,1:11:07.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,十二颗圆形弹匣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twelve round mag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.20,1:11:10.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,仅剩五颗子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.75,1:11:17.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,三颗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.27,1:11:34.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's going on out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.99,1:11:47.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,没子弹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.85,1:12:14.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿黛尔 桑德进屋了 找出目标位置并射击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adele, Xander's in. Find the target, light him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.11,1:12:20.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,吉本斯深信你一定会返回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gibbons thought you'd be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.86,1:12:23.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,来当我们需要的英雄角色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be the hero we needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.11,1:12:30.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你若是把盒子还给 国家安全局…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take the box to the NSA,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.70,1:12:32.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们就功亏一篑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we're right back to where we started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.50,1:12:41.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,这真是令人感伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is touching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.46,1:12:46.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,吉本斯看到你们两人 携手合作一定会倍感欣慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gibbons would be proud to see you two working together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.47,1:12:55.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不会有事的 桑德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm walking out of here, Xander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.40,1:13:00.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要知道一个秘密吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to know a secret?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.73,1:13:02.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,你忘了涂抹体香剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You forgot to put deodorant on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.07,1:13:08.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,吉本斯是我杀的 他是个自以为正义的白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I killed Gibbons because he was a self-righteous prick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.24,1:13:08.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,能瞄准吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a shot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.04,1:13:10.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,他还以为自己是正义的化身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He thought he had the right to police the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.91,1:13:12.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿黛尔 瞄准目标了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adele, do you have eyes on the target?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.24,1:13:14.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我转换至热瞄准范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm switching to thermal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.66,1:13:17.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我无论如何 都不会停止引爆卫星…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was never going to stop downing satellites{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.92,1:13:22.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道为何 因为这世界全是一派胡言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no matter what happened. You know why? Because this world has turned...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.09,1:13:25.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托告诉我你找到射击点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, please, please tell me you have a shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.55,1:13:26.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.72,1:13:29.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,他提升了屋内的温度 我什么也看不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's turned the heat up. I can't see shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.26,1:13:31.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,桑德 我看不见你们的位置 热瞄准范围不管用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}X can't see you guys. Thermal's no good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.85,1:13:33.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,–是吗 –你的温度太高 我看不见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right? - I've lost you in the heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.89,1:13:35.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看不到世界的变化吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't see what's going on in this world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.48,1:13:36.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.89,1:13:40.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,–你打算怎么做 –冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, what are you gonna do about it? - Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.11,1:13:45.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,桑德 继续让他说话 我还没找到射击点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}X, keep Chatty Cathy talking. I still don't have a shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.36,1:13:49.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,一切都是我们造成的 是吉本斯和你们还有我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We made it that way. People like Gibbons and the two of you. And me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.45,1:13:51.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我们搞砸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We made it that way. I mean, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.91,1:13:55.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,这世界若不被重整 每天活着有什么意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the point of getting up in the morning if you're not gonna reboot the world, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.79,1:13:56.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,冷静下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.08,1:14:00.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,外头发生战争了 我们为了生存的战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a war out there. We're at war for our survival, you don't see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.62,1:14:02.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,成千上万的人死得毫无价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Millions of people have died for nothing... It's their right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.92,1:14:05.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,看样子你又得欠我一命了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Read between the lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.80,1:14:08.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,–我说对了吗 –我对你老实说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Isn't it right? - I'm gonna be honest with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.42,1:14:10.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,一直让我心烦的事…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's been bugging me this whole time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.76,1:14:15.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你牙缝中 夹了一些食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is you've got something stuck in between your teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.43,1:14:17.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,–你在胡说什么 –我是认真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell are you talking about? - I'm serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.27,1:14:19.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's wrong with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.44,1:14:21.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,就在…这个位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.74,1:14:29.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,完美的射击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.90,1:14:31.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有迟疑过吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was there ever a doubt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.74,1:14:34.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 我承认我有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I confess, I had my doubts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.91,1:14:39.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是抹黑我朋友吉本斯的下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's for talking shit about my friend, Gibbons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.09,1:14:54.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,翔 跪下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xiang! Get on your knees! On your knees!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.51,1:14:57.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,手举起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands! Hands!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.14,1:14:59.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,快跪下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your knees, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.77,1:15:03.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,赶上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.61,1:15:10.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,当心点 凯奇 你再继续这样会被误认为好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out, Cage. Keep this up, people might mistake you for one of the good guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.36,1:15:14.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 政府官员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.20,1:15:21.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你达到目的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got what you wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.87,1:15:23.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都知道他不是坏人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We both know he's not the bad guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.71,1:15:25.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,那莫斯科一事该怪罪于谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And who do we blame for Moscow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.04,1:15:29.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,活生生的恐怖分子 总好过一个死掉的政府官员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better a living terrorist than a dead company man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.80,1:15:31.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你明白我说什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see what I'm saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.22,1:15:34.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,回到机上 二十分钟后起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Back on the plane. lwantwheels up in 20.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.14,1:15:36.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.23,1:15:44.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们夺回了潘多拉魔盒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We recovered Pandora's Box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.73,1:15:47.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们会派来一组押解小队 来接送你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna send an extraction team to pick you guys up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.44,1:15:49.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是翔被他们逮捕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they're taking Xiang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.19,1:15:51.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,赛琳娜…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, Serena,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.07,1:15:54.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,若收不到我的答复 切记 拨打9号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you don't hear from me, remember, dial nine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.24,1:15:57.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,极限特工不会丢下彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xtakes care of its own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.41,1:15:59.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,你把盒子还给玛克了 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave it back to Marke, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.75,1:16:12.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,这地方真不错 宽敞又昂贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice place. Spacious. Expensive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.26,1:16:14.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.60,1:16:24.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.44,1:16:28.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 少量的死伤人数…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, minimal casualties. Triple-X performed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.73,1:16:31.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,极限特工的表现 超越了合理的范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}beyond any reasonable measure of expectation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.12,1:16:46.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我猜想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.29,1:16:50.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,那通电话是要 邀约我到总统府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was my invite to the Oval Office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.13,1:16:58.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,在十分钟前 极限特工计划正式被瓦解了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As of 10 minutes ago, the Triple-X program was officially shuttered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.14,1:17:03.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有特工将从记录档案中删除 并轨列为国家的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All active agents are to be erased from record and considered enemies of the state.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.98,1:17:08.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,拿枪对准我 从来都不是好办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just never a good idea to point a gun at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.32,1:17:17.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,国家安全局的押解小队 通常都全副武装吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, are NSA extraction teams normally armed like they're invading Fallujah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.49,1:17:19.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,通常不会 看守好这些男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, generally not. Watch the boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.95,1:17:23.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.50,1:17:26.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢 天哪 有麻烦了是不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, it's happening, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.67,1:17:28.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们即将展开枪战 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna start shooting at us, aren't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.54,1:17:30.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,–动作快 –快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - Clear out, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.63,1:17:32.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,是时候上场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's showtime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.67,1:17:34.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在同属一队了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess we're on the same team now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.51,1:17:35.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我一支枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.63,1:17:41.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道我的风格 只要把我瞄准对的方向就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know me. Wind me up, point me in the right direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.80,1:17:43.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.51,1:17:47.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,情况变得严重了 是该这个样子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This shit is getting real, isn't it? Is this what happens when shit gets real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.23,1:17:48.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.64,1:17:50.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,躲开子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just be where the bullets aren't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.36,1:17:54.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,很遗憾的 恐怖份子再度启动潘多拉盒子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sadly, the terrorist activated Pandora's Box{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.86,1:17:57.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们无法阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one last time before we could stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.70,1:18:02.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和整个团队在仪器爆炸时 全军覆没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and your entire team were lost in the blast along with the device itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.20,1:18:06.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,这世界若是认为 潘多拉魔盒被毁灭了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the world thinks Pandora's Box is gone,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.50,1:18:09.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,就无法得知 我们正用来监督他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then they won't know we're using it to spy on them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.50,1:18:11.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不过是另一个暴君\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just another tyrant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.54,1:18:13.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 是爱国者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Patriot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.67,1:18:15.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我来教育你这其中的分别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me educate you on the difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.26,1:18:17.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,桑德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xander!{\r}
