Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.06,1:18:28.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,听说死亡是最终的历险记 凯奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say it's the last great adventure, Cage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.80,1:18:30.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,记得给我们寄明信片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be sure and send a postcard.{\r}
