Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.24,1:18:40.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,–快走 –分散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go, go! - Everybody, fan out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.07,1:18:43.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,找掩护 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find cover! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.24,1:18:44.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,过去那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get behind there!{\r}
