Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.56,1:19:08.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,真刺激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a rush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.06,1:19:12.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死的 贝姬 这防弹背心真了得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, Becky, that's some body armor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.73,1:19:21.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 都说了你这人没礼貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. I told you you got no manners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.45,1:19:25.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你母亲没教会你 要拉好拉链吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did your mother ever teach you howto zip up your pants?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.29,1:19:34.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well?{\r}
