Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.14,1:19:47.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在正忙着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're a bit busy now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.60,1:19:51.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,玛克掌握了潘多拉魔盒 她即将在你们上方引爆卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marke's got Pandora's Box. She's gonna drop a satellite on top of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.81,1:19:55.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,她即将对我们引爆卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gonna drop a satellite on us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.77,1:19:58.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我若把信号阻塞就引爆不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if I jam the signal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.61,1:20:02.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要电源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a power source!{\r}
