Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.48,1:20:40.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看是否能找到 那个特种部队士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See if I can't find G.I. Joe.{\r}
