Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.37,1:26:30.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了 不反驳吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong, hotshot? No witty comeback?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.54,1:26:33.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我刚刚算出了 算术的解答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just finally figured out that math problem.{\r}
