Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.40,1:26:58.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,数量太多了 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit. Way too many. Let's get out of here.{\r}
