Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.91,1:29:59.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,玛克启动了卫星 现在正朝着我们的方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xander, Marke activated the satellite and it's headed right for us.{\r}
