Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.09,1:30:11.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,低轨道自由落体 没有滑槽和大烟花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Low-orbit freefall, no chute and big fireworks.{\r}
