Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.51,1:33:37.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,要多坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How bad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.37,1:34:09.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个降落…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that right there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.71,1:34:11.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是超凡的入场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was a hell of an entrance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.63,1:34:14.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,那台车子真是超绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a hell of a car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.22,1:34:18.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,吉本斯要我看守好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Gibbons told me to keep an eye on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.05,1:34:21.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,他说我到时候 就会明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said I'd know why when I need to know why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.06,1:34:24.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在总算明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I know why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.06,1:34:27.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,和当年一样 原封不动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's exactly the way I left it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.64,1:34:29.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有开出去赴约过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Itook iton adateortwo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.69,1:34:32.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,极限特工不会丢下彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}X takes care of its own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.82,1:34:34.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以你才会及时出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I figured you'd come through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.03,1:34:38.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,能够跟传奇人物桑德·凯奇 一同共事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To get a chance to work with the legendary Xander Cage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.65,1:34:40.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,要到何处报名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do I sign up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.00,1:34:54.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道自己杠上了 不好惹的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you done pissed on the wrong damn picnic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.55,1:34:56.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会被全世界通缉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole world gonna be looking for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.34,1:35:03.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还是会做出同样的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't have it any other way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.94,1:36:42.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们用奥古斯最爱的歌 来做完结吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought we'd end with Augustus' favorite song.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.32,1:36:43.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇 这套把戏真了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's an impressive trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.32,1:36:45.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.16,1:36:48.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有你一人 懂得如何装死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think you're the only one who knows how to play dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.00,1:36:52.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,上当了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.17,1:36:59.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,参加自己的葬礼 那种感觉真离奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is some pretty surreal shit, being at your own funeral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.84,1:37:08.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 真是爱死这首歌了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love that song.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.31,1:37:12.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们若不做那么多坏事…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it could be a wonderful world,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.02,1:37:15.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,这世界的确可以很美好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if we just stopped doing bad shit to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.81,1:37:20.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你若想要我重出江湖 大可以开口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you wanted me out of retirement, you could've just asked me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.15,1:37:24.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你一向来不会动心于 微不足道的动机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always responded to less subtle motivation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.16,1:37:28.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在要做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.37,1:37:31.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你继续当这世界 真正需要的反叛角色吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep being the rebel the world doesn't know it needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.70,1:37:35.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,看守好政府官员 打击内奸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch the watchers. Fight the enemy within.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.66,1:37:37.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,那太复杂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, that's so complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.54,1:37:38.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.71,1:37:41.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我为你简化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me simplify it for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.21,1:37:44.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,当个了不起的人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kick some ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.38,1:37:45.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,赢取女孩的欢心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.51,1:37:49.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,途中尽量显得潇洒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And tryto look dope while you're doing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.72,1:37:53.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,你懂得如何 "潇洒"对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do "dope," can't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.23,1:37:56.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你肯定行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.07,1:38:02.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,小内马尔 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Junior, let's bounce!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.69,1:38:04.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,回头见 桑德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you later, X.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.91,1:38:12.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,这绝对行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can definitely make that work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.63,1:38:26.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.81,1:38:41.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我被你耍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.11,1:38:45.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,骗到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.28,1:38:49.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是玩家 不是士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a soldier, I'm a bailer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.64,1:39:22.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,回头见 桑德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you later, X.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.54,1:39:41.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你肯定行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.17,1:39:51.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.59,1:37:02.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我心中想着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮And I think to myself∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.16,1:37:05.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,这世界的确可以很美好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮What a wonderful World∮{\r}
